  isFinal: 1
  edition: "Baku  \xB7  Late edition  \xB7  Vol. XII, No. 2??"
  flavorHeadlines:
  - Flight 214 Still Grounded; Airline Declines Comment
  - Airport Delays Enter Third Week
  - Clear Skies Forecast All Week
  leadHeadline: 'Hotel Caspian Rest: Guest in Room 414 Has Not Left in Weeks. Staff
    "Concerned"'
  leadDetail: Light under the door every night, 3 AM, Hotel Caspian Rest.
  leadReaction:
  - speaker: Dutch
    text: Room 414.
  - speaker: Dutch
    text: ...That's my room.
  arrivalLines:
  - speaker: Radio
    text: ...Caspian Air regrets to announce that flight 214 to New York is delayed.
      Passengers are asked to remain at their hotels. We will update you at three
      a.m.
  - speaker: Dutch
    text: Same announcement. Word for word.
  - speaker: Dutch
    text: Fine. Work it like any other scene.
  bookRevealLines:
  - speaker: Dutch
    text: There's a page at the back. I didn't write a new page.
  - speaker: Dutch
    text: ...It's my hand. I didn't write it.
  identifyLines:
  - speaker: Dutch
    text: Six signs. Every one of them checked.
  - speaker: Dutch
    text: Every one of them mine.
  - speaker: Dutch
    text: The fix says every tool in the bag. Fine. The mirror's where this room
      feels wrong.
  wrongToolLine: Nothing.
  resolveLines: []
